coroutine libraries) is from https://www.lua.org/ftp/lua-5.4.7.tar.gz
(sha256 9fbf5e28ef86c69858f6d3d34eccc32e911c1a28b4120ff3e84aaa70cfbf1e30),
Copyright (C) 1994-2024 Lua.org, PUC-Rio, MIT License. It is unmodified except
luaconf.h, where the build may set LUA_32BITS (the firmware uses 32-bit
integers and floats). License: LICENSES/Lua-MIT.txt.

Jet
---
Jet in engine/jet/ (a software 3D rasteriser; Sample.cpp, Example.cpp and the
example config left out) is from https://github.com/CubeCoders/Jet at commit
c56dfc0c012ba7a09a6e49b4123340ec24981441, Copyright (c) 2026 CubeCoders Limited,
MIT License. It is modified, each change marked "carts patch": Rasterizer gains
setBandBuffers and a column range (xBandMin, xBandMax); Scene gains
rasterizeBandInto and rasterizeListInto (drawing a band, or a binned list of
its triangles, into caller buffers, from two cores at once), drawOrder,
triangleRows and queuedTriangle, and rasterizeBand calls the shared
rasterizeBandWith; the trig tables are allocated by the first
initializeTrigTables (were static arrays); a frontend's JetConfig.hpp may
define PERF_CRITICAL (code placement). engine/stage.cpp adapts Jet's lighting
arithmetic (jetShadeBrightness, jetModulateRGB565) for its own pipeline.
License: LICENSES/Jet-MIT.txt.

