Hermes Gadget SDK
-----------------
The board drivers in board/ (axp2101.*, battery_curve.hpp, pcf85063.hpp,
speaker_pa.hpp, and the panel, touch and speaker code adapted in panel.cpp,
touch.cpp and speaker.cpp) and the helpers in support/ come from the Hermes
Gadget SDK, Copyright (c) 2026 Hermes Gadget SDK contributors, MIT License
(the same terms as LICENSE). The carts engine was first written inside a fork
of that SDK and moved here.

Waveshare
---------
The CO5300 start-up commands for the 410x502 module (board/panel.cpp) and the
ESP32-S3-Touch-AMOLED-2.06 pin map (board/board.hpp) follow Waveshare's board
support package for the ESP32-S3-Touch-AMOLED-2.06, version 2.0.0,
https://github.com/waveshareteam/Waveshare-ESP32-components/tree/9daffb7168b3c093a330da700988a22092294eef/bsp/esp32_s3_touch_amoled_2_06,
Apache License 2.0 (LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt), checked against the
manufacturer's schematic.

